<mxGraphModel><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;LaminarFlow-Frontend/src/features/tickets/components/TicketList.tsx&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="30" width="760" y="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Andale Mono&quot;&gt;export function&lt;/font&gt; — a React function component&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;placeholder data until LAM-7 lands the API contract; the folder shape is the point of&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;this file, not the content. The module-level const tickets is a hard-coded string[]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;that is not carded on its own — it disappears the moment the real fetch arrives.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="80" width="760" y="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Imports&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;import { &lt;a href=&quot;#func#Button&quot;&gt;Button&lt;/a&gt; } from &#39;@/components/ui/Button&#39;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;export function &lt;b&gt;TicketList()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="80" width="760" y="370" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Returns JSX.Element — a &amp;lt;section&amp;gt; holding an h1, one &amp;lt;li&amp;gt; per placeholder title,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;and a single Button. It takes no props, so it renders the same thing every time.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="40" width="760" y="450" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;-&amp;gt; return ( &amp;lt;section&amp;gt; … &amp;lt;/section&amp;gt; )&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="30" width="760" y="490" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;const tickets = [&#39;Split the backend CI&#39;, &#39;Stand up the frontend test harness&#39;]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;{&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;return (&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;section&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;h1&amp;gt;Tickets&amp;lt;/h1&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;ul&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;{tickets.map((title) =&amp;gt; (&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;li key={title}&amp;gt;{title}&amp;lt;/li&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;))}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/ul&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;&lt;a href=&quot;#func#Button&quot;&gt;Button&lt;/a&gt;&amp;gt;New ticket&amp;lt;/&lt;a href=&quot;#func#Button&quot;&gt;Button&lt;/a&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/section&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;key={title} uses the title itself because the placeholder rows have no ids yet — when&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;the contract lands, the ticket&#39;s real id becomes the key&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;the Button comes in through the @ alias, which vite.config.ts maps to src/ — that is&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;how a feature reaches the domain-agnostic ui/ folder without a relative-path climb&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="420" width="760" y="520" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>
